      "settings": {
        "preheader": "Getting there",
        "heading": "Atlanta, Georgia",
        "subheading": "<p>The address travels with your ticket. Expect intown Atlanta, minutes from the Beltline, with valet and rideshare access at the door.</p><p>Rideshare drop-off directly at the entrance · Valet from 6:00 PM · covered lots within a block · MARTA within a short ride · exact address sent with your ticket confirmation.</p>",
